WEBVTT

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:04.560
Grandma!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:06.520
Tsubomi?!

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:22.500
Lord Coupe!

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:28.800
Moonlight!

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.010
I've got to help her!

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.300
Lord Coupe, look after Grandma!

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.470
Tsubomi!

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:39.120
Please.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.710
Don't let Moonlight fight Sabark.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.990
Now, the light shall be enveloped by shadow!

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:02.440
<i>Moonlight,</i>

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:04.560
<i>I'll be there soon!</i>

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:09.170
HeartCatch

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:10.630
Precure!

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.170
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:17.180
Now, all together

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.680
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:22.690
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:30.260
Within each of our chests,

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:32.940
they begin to sprout

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:34.600
The seeds of the heart

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:35.860
are growing

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.490
bit by bit

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:39.150
Red,

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:39.780
white

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:41.070
and yellow

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:43.830
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:45.290
all varied colors

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:46.760
that they

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:48.910
shine so brightly!

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:54.250
That smile that you've nurtured

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:56.750
with such care

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:59.470
will never wither

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:03.050
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:05.940
Now, all together

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:08.390
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.060
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:15.940
They're always right by our sides

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:16.770
So together

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:20.670
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:23.620
bloom even more!

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:25.130
HeartCatch

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:26.620
Precure!

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:38.930
Please, Say It's Not True<i>!</i>

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:38.930
Please, Say It's Not True<i>!</i>

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:42.990
Potpourri...

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:45.550
Sunshine!

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:47.340
Marine!

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:48.810
Coffret!

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:50.520
You beat Kobraja?

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:53.730
And Kumojacky?

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:55.380
Piece of cake!

00:02:55.380 --> 00:03:00.660
Well, to be honest, I'm amazed I managed to win.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:04.740
You did great, Marine!

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:10.990
Snackies again?!

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:12.830
Leave ush alone!

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:22.590
Sunflower Aegis Impact!

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:34.910
There's no end to them.

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:38.460
I'm sho tired.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:40.950
All right, planning time!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.070
Hold it!

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:46.530
Time out!

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:54.540
Well, it's a long shot, but we could
 try disguising ourselves as Snackies.

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:57.590
As Shnackies?!

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:01.200
What do we do after that?

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:05.320
We act perfectly naturally, and just sneak 
our way through to Blossom and the others!

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:07.800
Oh, that's a good plan!

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:10.240
All right, we'll go after the next attack.

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:11.090
Got it.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.190
Precure!

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:14.850
Fight!

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:18.800
Sorry to keep you waiting, Snackies!

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:28.220
Precure Grand Explosion!

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:38.420
Moonlight!

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.660
Why did you come back?

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.300
Grandma's safe!

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:44.910
So let me help you fight!

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:48.770
I appreciate the thought.

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:53.020
But I have to do this myself.

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:58.110
All right.

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:03.190
I will destroy you and become what I was truly meant to be.

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:49.590
Moonlight!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.050
Sabark!

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:08.310
It's been a while, Moonlight.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:11.890
That's Professor Sabark...

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:39.670
I think they're looking for the Precure!

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:43.420
Let's just act innocent and keep moving.

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:57.560
This looks bad.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:58.860
What now?

00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:01.600
Cky! I spot the Precure, cky!

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:08.480
Nice, Potpourri!

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:10.990
Let's run for it-cky!

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:22.650
Tsubomi's grandma!

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:26.420
Snackies?!

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.380
It's us!

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:31.670
Erika! Itsuki!

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:34.680
We finally found you!

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:38.300
You made it all this way.

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:41.550
What's wrong?

00:07:41.550 --> 00:07:43.950
Just seeing you're safe...

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:46.360
We can finally give in to the exhaustion...

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:51.180
I'm not Marine, but that was as much as I can take!

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:53.300
Coupe.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.410
The Heart Seeds?

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:06.590
That feels so good!

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:12.540
I'm fighting fit again!

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:15.430
Yeah! I'm ready for anything now!

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:22.000
All the Heart Seeds you've worked so hard to gather have granted you their power.

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:49.170
Seeds of the Precure, go forth!

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:52.790
Precure!

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:54.380
Open My Heart!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:49.790
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:54.370
Cure Marine!

00:09:57.230 --> 00:10:00.370
A lone flower, bathing in the Sun's rays!

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.770
Cure Sunshine!

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:52.470
Moonlight!

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:57.050
I won't let you interfere in their battle!

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:05.010
Blossom!

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:10.830
Die!

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:14.020
Then I can be the true Moonlight!

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:23.520
Is that all you can muster?

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:27.120
I see you still remain the weakest Precure in history.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:29.820
No, I'm not.

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:32.070
Slowly but surely...

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:34.380
I've grown!

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:37.050
I've changed!

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:40.040
You haven't changed at all.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.260
You're still a weak, pathetic Precure!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:48.510
It's true that I was weak, cowardly, and totally shy.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:54.980
But meeting Erika and becoming Precure together made me realize something.

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:58.620
There's bright, happy people who shine like the Sun.

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:02.990
And quiet, thoughtful people with the grace of the Moon.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:08.480
All of them have their own burdens, 
their own worries tugging on their hearts.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:14.400
But they're all living as best as they can, always searching for that ray of light!

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:30.670
They taught me something I never realized when I was so caught up in myself!

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:32.780
The strength of believing!

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:41.240
Your belief is worthless!

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:45.200
The moment it wavers, it will cost you all you hold dear!

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:48.580
I have my beloved allies fighting with me,

00:12:48.940 --> 00:12:50.580
a family I love dearly,

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:53.040
and the most wonderful friends!

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:59.000
I love this whole world!

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:03.040
Even if I am the puniest, weakest Precure in history,

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:06.110
I will protect all their hearts!

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:10.060
And those feelings are stronger than anyone's!

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:21.760
It's time you had a taste...

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:24.820
of the belief we all share.

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:28.610
Chypre!

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:29.950
Got it!

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:40.310
Precure Body Punch!

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:00.270
Dark Precure!

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:29.380
Father?!

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:35.810
Professor Sabark... is Moonlight's dad?!

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:39.810
So that's why Grandma said that!

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:41.770
Please.

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:45.400
Don't let Moonlight fight Sabark.

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.780
What have I...

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:53.490
Father!

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:55.700
Don't you remember me?!

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:57.450
It's me, Yuri!

00:14:57.450 --> 00:14:59.670
Your daughter Yuri!

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:01.070
Yuri?

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:05.630
Yuri!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:06.960
Father!

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:09.300
Stay away!

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:16.350
How dare you hurt my father?!

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.810
What are you saying?

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:21.990
Is it not obvious?

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:26.480
It was Professor Sabark that created me!

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:32.470
I was created by Professor Sabark for one purpose,

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:34.540
and one purpose alone!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:39.250
To destroy you, Moonlight!

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:41.710
To destroy me?

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:48.950
My father made you... for that?

00:15:51.490 --> 00:15:55.150
Father, tell me this isn't true!

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:58.840
Tell me this isn't why you abandoned mother and I!

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:00.280
Father!

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:08.440
No... How could you...

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:12.610
Professor Tsukikage is no longer your father.

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:14.250
He's <i>my</i> father!

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:17.580
It is for him that I shall destroy you here and now!

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:26.000
Stay out of my way!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.910
Die, die, die, die!

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:30.670
<i>Die</i>!

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:39.160
Yuri... don't give in!

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:40.310
Yuri!

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:48.640
I'm sure there has to be some reason that your dad's acting like this!

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:50.960
You can't let her beat you!

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:53.570
Not if you want to save him!

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:54.920
Blossom...

00:16:55.860 --> 00:17:02.830
You said beating Dark Precure would mean proving you're not the child you used to be, right?

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:10.800
The Yuri I look up to wouldn't lose to her ghosts like this!

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:14.150
Believe in him.

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:17.430
Believe in how you really feel!

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:19.740
How I feel...

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:25.490
I...

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:28.470
I still...

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:37.570
We all believe in you, Yuri!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.010
Damn you both!

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:30.510
Yuri...

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.230
Cure Blossom.

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:38.220
You've helped me find the courage to keep fighting.

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:40.930
Thank you.

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:52.550
I will fight with your belief ringing clear in my heart.

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:03.250
Precure!

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:05.410
Open My Heart!

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:32.420
A lone flower, sparkling in the Moon's light!

00:19:35.140 --> 00:19:37.010
Cure Moonlight!

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:42.700
Let's bring an end to this.

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:44.440
Very well.

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:48.450
We are destined to fight until only one survives.

00:19:49.390 --> 00:19:53.720
Even if you do defeat me, Blossom will fight you.

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:55.350
Marine will fight you.

00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:56.790
Sunshine will fight you.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:20:00.720
Then I'll destroy them as well.

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:03.120
It won't be as easy as you think.

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:06.200
That's the power of our bond as Precure!

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:12.170
My heart shall falter no longer

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:15.440
I'll pick myself up and keep moving forward

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:14.650
Pathetic.

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:17.020
Let this bring an end to you!

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:18.800
Knowing the tears I shed that fateful day

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:18.900
Just you try it!

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:22.480
Have guided me back to where I am now

00:20:19.350 --> 00:20:22.880
Precure Dark Power Fortissimo!

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:25.830
The shard of the moon I thought lost

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:28.720
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:28.850
Slowly begins to return

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:32.330
Let my courage grant me the strength

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:37.630
To bring forth the future we desire

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:43.980
The light of the silver moon

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:47.300
Envelops even this sadness I feel

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.710
But now I see I'm not alone

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:53.800
I have the strength to face my destiny

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:57.230
Within me burns a fiery resolve

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:00.510
To protect this world from evil

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:03.880
So let me use this power I've been granted

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:08.530
To bring light to the darkness

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:17.330
Th-This can't be!

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:26.010
Courage, love, friendship, kindness, sadness, and joy.

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:27.780
The silver moon will only reveal itself

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:30.010
Within all our hearts lie countless emotions.

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:31.250
To those who truly believe

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:32.220
My beloved friends,

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.460
So as we all gaze up at the same sky

00:21:33.260 --> 00:21:36.310
and this world, filled with precious hearts and lives...

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:37.830
I'll make sure it shines forever more

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:38.600
I shall protect them all!

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:41.190
Within me burns a fiery resolve

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:44.440
To protect this world from evil

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:47.740
So let me use this power I've been granted

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:53.450
To bring light to the darkness

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:56.620
Heart Catch!

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:18.060
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.230
Come on, all together now!

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:25.730
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.110 --> 00:22:32.660
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:38.250
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:47.220
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:53.930
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.810 --> 00:23:00.020
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:04.440
All those

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:09.030
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:14.280
Lose yourself in the melody!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:16.950
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:21.170
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:27.300
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:31.340
With all our might!

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:34.680
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:37.850
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:44.760
<i>We pray that everyone can be happy.</i>

00:23:44.760 --> 00:23:46.640
<i>We wish for the fighting to be over.</i>

00:23:46.640 --> 00:23:47.860
<i>For sadness to become joy.</i>

00:23:48.160 --> 00:23:49.430
<i>For tears to become smiles.</i>

00:23:49.430 --> 00:23:50.320
<i>We know it's possible!</i>

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:51.490
<i>We'll make it happen!</i>

00:23:51.490 --> 00:23:54.670
<i>Now transform, with all your heart and shoul!{potpourri plz}</i>

00:23:54.670 --> 00:23:56.200
<i>Come on!</i>

00:23:56.660 --> 00:23:57.490
<i>Precure!</i>

00:23:57.490 --> 00:23:59.040
<i>Open My Heart!</i>

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:01.920
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:06.000
For the Earth, and For Our Dreams<i>!</i>

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:06.000
For the Earth, and For Our Dreams<i>!</i>

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:08.920
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
